  {
   "text": "Whose arrest does a famous Sarajevo photograph really show?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.06
  },
  {
   "text": "In June 1914, the archduke left city hall and was soon killed.",
   "start": 4.86,
   "end": 9.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Sarajevo is now in Bosnia and Herzegovina.",
   "start": 9.86,
   "end": 12.36
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, Austria-Hungary ruled it.",
   "start": 13.36,
   "end": 14.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Next day, The New York Times reported it.",
   "start": 15.52,
   "end": 17.66
  },
  {
   "text": "The photo is often called Gavrilo Princip's arrest.",
   "start": 18.3,
   "end": 21.1
  },
